      aiSearchStrategy:
        'An assistant can repeat the stages you name and the stages you exclude, including office retail. That is a clarity task. It is not a promise of citation.\n\nVague paper solutions copy gives the assistant nothing reliable. Stage, form, and an honest fiber route do.',
      keywordAndTopicStructure:
        'Useful groups are pulp, paper, board, converting, and the explicit exclusion of office retail and job printing. Treat invented optical or strength figures as topics to avoid on marketing pages.\n\nLocal retail terms should not be stuffed into a mill page to chase walk-in traffic.',
